"The Sink is a throat of the Depths, running down to their upper layers."
"It opened because the wardstone's seal has run down after four centuries and the rock gave way."
"Skeletons of Level 18 to 26 climb out at night and wander the deep fen."
"Hollow Crawlers, pale eyeless many-legged hunters of Level 28 to 35, have begun to climb out."
"A Hollow Crawler is the pale long-limbed thing Hessa Vane saw take her husband."
"The beasts fleeing east all summer are fleeing what climbs out of the Sink."
"Deeper down waits an intelligent undead near Level 60, sending lesser dead up to test the seal."
"Each month the seal weakens, and larger and stronger things climb nearer the top."
"Within a season, things strong enough to overrun Fenwatch will climb out."
"It closes if the wardstone wakes, or if the throat is collapsed with everything climbing in it."
